{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09524","headline":"读後汉逸人传二首 二 · 张谓","name":"读後汉逸人传二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庞公南郡人，家在襄阳里。\n何处偏来往，襄阳东陂是。\n誓将业田种，终得保妻子。\n何言二千石，乃欲劝吾仕。\n鹳鹊巢茂林，鼋鼍穴深水。\n万物从所欲，吾心亦如此。\n不见鹿门山，朝朝白云起。\n采药复采樵，优游终暮齿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}